{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん、こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "17歳 渡辺莉奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "完全に夏ですねー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "暑さに負けてしまいそうです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "去年何してたっけーって写真フォルダ見返してたら四期生でジンギスカン会してました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "懐かしい、！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またご飯会企画したいなー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "22日に発売されました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "週刊少年マガジンさんの表紙を務めさせていただいております⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メディア賞ぶりのマガジンさんです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に嬉しい！ありがとうございます^^"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobwVuDSC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobcsqZHh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobA4MGGS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobAfSKf0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobp7tdp5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobXSZR9W.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mob2aBcrR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobsX6QIB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "猫ちゃんにも遭遇しました。はあ可愛い"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影中ずっと笑ってました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初山形だったのですが、美味しいご飯もいただけて、夏をたくさん感じれて幸せでした~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自然体な姿が印象的なグラビアになったんじゃないかなと思います！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても素敵な撮影でした^^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひお手に取ってみてください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}